{"parse": {"title": "FG-03", "pageid": 23008, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FG-02\" title=\"FG-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FG-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/FG-04\" title=\"FG-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A9.BA.E4.B8.AD.E8.88.9E.E8.B9.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"空中舞蹈\">空中舞蹈</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 空中舞蹈</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Car-top Dancing</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>广<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>普<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>《<span class=\"color-value\"></span>城<span class=\"color-value\"></span>市<span class=\"color-value\"></span>交<span class=\"color-value\"></span>通<span class=\"color-value\"></span>规<span class=\"color-value\"></span>范<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>行<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>准<span class=\"color-value\"></span>则<span class=\"color-value\"></span>》<span class=\"color-value\"></span>确<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191903</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_dianhuatexie\"><img alt=\"at_dianhuatexie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/600px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/900px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/1200px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>怎么样，伙计，你帮我盯着那家伙了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话那头：</div><div>环状水星吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>老天，还能有谁，我养你在外头不是让你白吃饭的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话那头：</div><div>哥，我知道，我盯着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话那头：</div><div>她好像还带上了她的神秘学同伴。一个忠心耿耿的……小神秘学同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>……哈，我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“断指”：</div><div>把那个小同伴看紧点，要是她中途放弃了这个任务，或者找到了“小刀”麦高芬却不愿意交出来的话，你知道该怎么做。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪。<br />&lt;不是所有犬类都喜欢喝牛奶。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……呜——汪……<br />&lt;我们偶尔也会深受乳糖不耐受的烦扰。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，呜汪……<br />&lt;……噢，不过我倒是不介意，如果有剩余的牛奶，我想舔上一口解解渴。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>别急，皮克勒斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我感觉到一股新的能量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星将刚买的牛奶倒进一个破烂小碗里，缓缓推向路边的一摊小垃圾堆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从垃圾堆里面探出一只小鼻子，颤抖地伸到碗前，拱了两下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，吽，汪汪汪汪，呜汪。&lt;前三只流浪狗都已经被送回到他们原本属于的地方——一个被人类称为“家”的地方。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪汪，汪。<br />&lt;但截至目前，关于“小刀”麦高芬的行踪，我们还是一无所获。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哔——哔哔——哔——”小狗脖子上戴着的呼叫机响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>能听到吗？皮克勒斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽！汪汪汪。<br />&lt;能听到，亲爱的洋葱头女士。您临行前给我装的这个呼叫机终于起作用了？&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗对呼叫机发出疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>噢！噢，你是指呼叫机？是的，它能保证我随时获取你们的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺——<br />&lt;噢，看来您聆听了一路。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗发出谴责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪——<br />&lt;不，我并不是这个意思——&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-305411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-305411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-305411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>一个新闻记者需要见缝插针地获得所有对自己有利的信息，这可是一种“职业态度”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>回归正题，你们还没有找到“小刀”麦高芬？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯从喉咙里发出两声哼哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>但你们似乎找到了很多其他的流浪狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，呜汪汪汪，汪汪。&lt;是的，我们找到了几只走丢的流浪狗，从它们失而复得的主人那儿得到了一笔犒赏。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯回头看向环状水星，从她的裤袋和背包能看得出里面鼓鼓囊囊的，装的都是钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗对他们赚到的钱感到非常满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，狺……汪。<br />&lt;噢，噢——我不是对钱感到满意，我只是觉得这也算是一种劳动的收获。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>我明白了，通过帮助主人找到他们丢失的小狗，你们赚到了一大笔钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>但你们并没找到真正的“小刀”麦高芬？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗略显低沉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>看来这完全不是易事，怪不得“断指”把最后的希望放在环状水星小姐的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>新闻记者的敏感告诉我——你们这趟旅程恐怕听上去不简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>要么就是无功而返，要么就是倍受牵连，或者二者都有，总而言之……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼叫机那头停顿了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>从记者的角度来看，我非常希望继续跟进你们的行动；但从一个完全客观的第三方角度来看——我也想提醒一下，或许你们可以再考虑一下是否要继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记者在另一头等待着回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>……喂？喂？听得到吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>银发的少女似乎并没留意呼叫机中的声音，而是在空气中寻觅着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她突然抬起头，直勾勾地盯着对面的马路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>薄如蝉翼，和空气的介质相同……还有……一丁点的颤抖，如黑蚂蚁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低跟鞋飞快地踩在水泥地面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星跨上马路边的栏杆。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_ys_huanzhuangshuixing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一跃跳入车水马龙的行车道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>溜走了——好快——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽！汪汪汪！！！<br />&lt;环状水星女士，您要去哪里？&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯看到这一幕赶忙跟过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但碍于马路边竖起的高高栏杆和排放着“凶猛”尾气的电动汽车，这只小狗只能隔着栏杆在这岸摆动尾巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而环状水星已经踩在汽车的顶棚，一蹦一跳地、自如地在一辆辆汽车顶棚上行走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红的、白的、黑的、绿的，她的脚踩在炙热的车顶，像舞蹈，又像是在玩着一种别致的儿童游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>东南方，正在快速消失……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星闭着眼睛感受着，念叨着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">司机：</div><div>嘿，下来！女孩！危险！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车主们无一不探出脑袋冲着环状水星嚷嚷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空中扬起的发梢轻盈如水母，她甚至不用回头，话语就已经抵达人们的头顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>没关系，正常开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我不会踩空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪——！<br />&lt;环状水星女士——&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗的赤胆忠心不允许它在这种危机时刻弃人类于不顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更多的汽车喇叭一起鸣笛，原因是一条狗也跟着这位女孩一起跳了上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是一人一狗，踩在烈日炎炎下五彩斑斓的车顶上，为自己开辟了一条通达对岸的、一往无前的空中之路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-501620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-501620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-501620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">盯梢者：</div><div>……我的……老天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>暗处的阴影里，有位一直盯梢的人，瞠目结舌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒獒！<br />&lt;您要去哪里？！&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>南方……黑蚁与暖流……!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你知道我在说什么……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗完全理解你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>你们在做什么？——嘿，我这边信号不好！喔噢——慢点，慢点！！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FG-03"}}